// Pocket Tech: a rounded shell for a cluster, a round jewel for a hobby.
//
// Three hobbies are drawn as a pocket player and one — photography — as a
// camera with no pictogram in it at all, the casing being the whole drawing.
// Both are the kit's decisions, detected rather than listed, so a kit that
// changes its mind is picked up on the next regeneration.
